<title>USA: Mid-States names Cook chief executive.</title>
<headline>Mid-States names Cook chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-States Plc said Friday it appointed William Cook as chief executive, as well as a director, effective immediately.  </p>
<p>Mid-States said in a release that Cook, previously president and chief executive officer at Hartmann Luggage Co, replaces Bernard Keith Jr., who will remain on the board and has been appointed senior vice president of operations.</p>
</text>
